106661921のしまりんと同程度かやや大きめでお願いします。\n⑤差分を描けるのであれば、水浴びの場合は木々（枝や葉）、風呂の場合は湯気か小物（桶など）で大事なところが隠れているものをお願いします。\n⑥表情や背景、目線などその他の事はそちらに一任します。\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/754XaC6.jpg", "nc": 184, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 7203, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "つるせ▲", "screen_name": "tsuruse852", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2051951284425728000/5Dg_EY6X.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 12, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 132790, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "クーガー", "screen_name": "cougar1404", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1916028393285685248/f5Cng2E9.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/984625048752279553/1781005868/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 199074, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "無人＠Skeb作業中", "screen_name": "MUJINZAIRAISEN", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1811526232997240832/Cwzck-ce.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/900760700271734785/1728256762/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 160}, {